---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Closing from '../components/Closing.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import landscape from '../assets/foothills.png';
---
<Layout title="About Blake & Fenrir | Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service" description="Meet Blake Bannon, owner of Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service in Bailey, Colorado. Direct communication and a clear plan for local workplaces.">
  <section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">Owner-operated. Based in Bailey.</p><h1>Local work.<br/><em>Personal attention.</em></h1><p class="intro-lead">Care for a workplace begins with understanding the people who use it.</p></section>
  <section class="about-story container"><figure class="landscape-figure"><Image src={landscape} alt="Warm light on pine trees, granite, and rolling foothills." widths={[480,800,1200]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 45vw" width={640} height={720} fit="cover" format="webp"/><figcaption>Pine, granite, and a little afternoon light. Illustrative landscape.</figcaption></figure><div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Hello, I’m Blake.</p><h2>Your space.<br/>Our conversation.</h2><p>I’m Blake Bannon, the owner of Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service. I’m based in Bailey and serve commercial workplaces in Bailey, Conifer, and Evergreen.</p><p>I want working with your cleaner to feel straightforward. You should know who to talk to, which tasks are included, and when the work is planned.</p><p>That starts with a walkthrough. We look at the space together, discuss what needs attention, and work toward a written scope that fits how your business operates.</p><p>From the first conversation onward, you work directly with me. If your priorities change or something needs a closer look, we can talk it through.</p><div class="owner-signature"><span>Blake Bannon</span><small>Owner, Fenrir Commercial Cleaning Service</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="section about-expectations container"><p class="eyebrow">What you can expect</p><h2>Simple commitments.<br/>Careful follow-through.</h2><div class="about-values"><article><span class="index-number">01</span><h3>A shared understanding.</h3><p>We agree on the rooms, tasks, frequency, and access arrangements before cleaning begins.</p></article><article><span class="index-number">02</span><h3>A clear proposal.</h3><p>Your written cleaning proposal reflects your space and scope. Initial resets or specialist needs are discussed separately.</p></article><article><span class="index-number">03</span><h3>An open conversation.</h3><p>You have a direct point of contact for questions, adjustments, and the everyday details that matter in your building.</p></article></div><a class="text-link" href="/#included">Explore what’s included <Arrow/></a></section>
  <Closing/>
</Layout>
